    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not like there's anyone else to take the weight though. i'm the only one left. if i stop, everything just crashes. it's like i'm stuck in this nightmare and the only way to actually get some peace is to just... not be here. does that even make sense? it feels like the only logical way to stop the pain.",
